  "intro": "A 4-wide, one-layer Transformer reads “the cat sat” and the shifted target “<s> die Katze”, predicts the next word at all three positions, and takes one Adam step so that “die”, “Katze” and “saß” become a little more likely. Watch how the error signal flows back through the decoder and, via cross-attention, into the encoder.",
